"Slash Killer!"

00:11:06.480 --> 00:11:07.940
This is the first live version!

00:11:07.940 --> 00:11:09.730
This intro is fuckin' fierce!

00:11:16.570 --> 00:11:18.570
Shit! What the hell am I doing?!

00:11:20.330 --> 00:11:23.330
It's that woman's birthday today!

00:11:23.330 --> 00:11:24.250
Dammit all!

00:11:24.460 --> 00:11:25.410
Dammit all to Hell!

00:11:25.870 --> 00:11:27.000
That was awesome!

00:11:27.000 --> 00:11:27.920
It fuckin' ruled!

00:11:27.920 --> 00:11:28.630
If I don't get back there quick,

00:11:28.630 --> 00:11:30.090
she might've gone home!

00:11:30.090 --> 00:11:31.420
Shit! Why am I doing this?!

00:11:31.420 --> 00:11:32.250
If she...

00:11:32.250 --> 00:11:33.420
If only that bitch wasn't alive!

00:11:33.420 --> 00:11:34.760
I wouldn't have to suffer like this!

00:11:34.760 --> 00:11:37.220
I hope this zit goes away soon.

00:11:37.220 --> 00:11:38.430
Oh, Negishi-kun.

00:11:38.430 --> 00:11:40.680
She thinks she's so special just because it's her damn birthday!

00:11:44.480 --> 00:11:46.190
You're horrible, Negishi-kun!

00:11:46.190 --> 00:11:49.020
I even told you that I was feeling bad about this zit!

00:11:49.020 --> 00:11:50.650
No! I got too excited!

00:11:50.650 --> 00:11:54.530
I thought if I touched it, you'd feel better... I mean...!

00:11:54.530 --> 00:11:57.570
And with that, I gave Aikawa-san the worst birthday ever...

00:11:57.570 --> 00:11:59.870
I-I thought you'd feel better if I popped it for you...!

00:11:59.870 --> 00:12:01.280
The earlier the better!

00:12:01.280 --> 00:12:03.080
And here's the present I meant to give you.

00:12:03.080 --> 00:12:06.790
The next day, her zit disappeared, and I got a thank you call from Aikawa-san.

00:13:43.760 --> 00:13:44.970
Hello, I'm Kaji Hideki.

00:13:44.970 --> 00:13:46.180
Are you enjoying the show?

00:13:46.850 --> 00:13:49.020
What will happen to Negishi-kun in the next episode?

00:13:49.020 --> 00:13:51.850
Even though I'm in London right now, I can't wait!

00:13:51.850 --> 00:13:53.350
Kaji Hideki, saying goodbye.
